PARITY reproduced exactly from the web source (cross-platform value parity)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Total entries  = fmtInt(data.count)                                 sublabel "in dead-letter queue"  (Inbox -> tray.full)
  Replayable     = fmtInt(entries.filter(e => e.replayable).length)   sublabel "parsed with source topic" (ShieldCheck -> checkmark.shield)
  Replay mode    = enabled ? "Enabled" : "Disabled"                   sublabel "DLQ_REPLAY_ENABLED env" (AlertOctagon -> exclamationmark.octagon)
  Warning banner = {!loading && !enabled && <AlertBanner variant="warning"
                     title="DLQ replay is disabled">...HTTP 403...result="disabled"...</AlertBanner>}
  Grid           = <Grid cols={{ default: 1, sm: 3 }} gap={4}>  ->  adaptive 1-up (compact) / 3-up (regular)

